OL,3,GNEWSAChris Thomas elected as Isle of
OL,4,AMan chief minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Thomas has been selected as the
OL,7,FIsle of Man's new chief minister.
OL,9,FThomas received the backing of 22
OL,10,FMembers of the House of Keys (MHKs) in
OL,11,Fa contest with newcomer to national
OL,12,Fpolitics Kirrie Jenkins.
OL,14,FThomas won the first ballot by 16 votes
OL,15,Fto six and later secured the backing of
OL,16,Fall but two members.
OL,18,FThe Douglas Central MHK, who is one of
OL,19,Fthe island's longest serving Tynwald
OL,20,Fmembers, will now appoint a Council of
OL,21,FMinisters to head up the eight
OL,22,Fgovernment departments.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
